              "ennegram_name": "The Reformer",
              "ennegram_description": "The Reformer is rational, idealistic, and principled. They are motivated by a desire to live a life of integrity and purpose, striving to make a positive impact on the world. Reformers are ethical, responsible, and self-disciplined, with a strong sense of right and wrong. They are driven by a desire to improve themselves and the world around them, seeking to create a more just and harmonious society. Reformers are often seen as perfectionists, with high standards for themselves and others. They are committed to their values and beliefs, willing to stand up for what they believe in, even in the face of opposition. Reformers are dedicated to making a difference in the world, using their intelligence, creativity, and passion to effect positive change.",
              "business_model_you": "How I interact",
              "tagline": "Building the Pillars of Purposeful Relationships",
              "logline": "Foundation of Virtue is a transformative guide to building meaningful relationships through the power of virtue and ethical living. Drawing on the wisdom of ancient philosophy and modern psychology, this book offers readers a blueprint for cultivating honesty, integrity, and compassion in their interactions with others. Through interactive exercises and AI-driven simulations, readers will learn how to align their actions with their core values, fostering trust, respect, and empathy in their relationships. By mastering the art of ethical living, readers can create a solid foundation for purposeful and fulfilling connections that stand the test of time.",
              "description": "This book explores the foundational principles of virtue and ethical living, emphasizing the importance of honesty, integrity, and compassion in building meaningful relationships. Drawing on a rich variety of sources, including philosophy, psychology, and contemporary research, this book offers readers a blueprint for cultivating these core values in their interactions with others. Through interactive exercises and AI-driven simulations, readers will learn how to align their actions with their values, fostering trust, respect, and empathy in their relationships. By mastering the art of ethical living, readers can create a solid foundation for purposeful and fulfilling connections that stand the test of time.",
