                              "scene_number": 1,
                              "scene_title": "Timeline Bandits Attack",
                              "setup": "Hours into their journey aboard the Zanetti Train, Francisco experiences his first combat when timeline bandits attack the locomotive. As the train weaves between realities, Francisco must use his Trionfi cards defensively while the hardened mercenaries protect him. His academic world view shatters as he witnesses violence up close and realizes the deadly seriousness of his quest.",
                              "symbolism": "The attacking bandits represent the chaos that threatens all timelines. Francisco's trembling hands holding the cards symbolize his transition from theoretical knowledge to practical application. The train's acceleration through realities mirrors Francisco's rapid maturation under pressure.",
