                              "setup": "As evening approaches, the Zanetti Train reaches the borders of Pangaea. Francisco witnesses his first glimpse of the mystical realm - landscapes that shift between realities, mountains that float in mid-air, and forests where the trees grow backward through time. Roger points out landmarks and explains the temporal instabilities ahead, while Francisco's Trionfi cards begin to resonate more powerfully with the magical energies surrounding them.",
