                      "major_task_group_title": "Harmony",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Harmony is the state of balance, unity, and coherence that arises from the integration of diverse elements. It is the alignment of mind, body, and spirit, creating a sense of peace, wholeness, and well-being. Harmony is a key principle in building healthy relationships, fostering creativity, and promoting personal growth. By cultivating harmony within oneself and with others, individuals can create a supportive and nurturing environment that enables them to thrive and flourish. The state of balance, unity, and coherence that arises from the integration of diverse elements.",
