                          "epic_preliminary_scene_focus": "Approach to the Innermost Cave",
                          "epic_preliminary_scene_description": "Juxtaposing prior scarcity with present abundance illuminates new responsibilities inherent in prosperity. The group prepares to delve deeper, armed with the perspective that true wealth demands stewardship.",
                          "epic_novel_chapter_focus": "Scene VII: The Road of Trials",
