                          "epic_preliminary_scene_focus": "The Reward",
                          "epic_preliminary_scene_description": "After weathering storms, persistence yields breakthroughs and hard‑won wisdom. Yet new horizons demand continued endurance.",
                          "epic_novel_chapter_focus": "Scene VIII: The Supreme Ordeal",
