                          "emotional_journey": "From mysterious ally to revealed cosmic goddess, showing her true nature as a guide for conscious cosmic leadership",
                          "key_realization": "The time has come to reveal her divine nature and provide the profound guidance Francisco and Zara need for their cosmic destiny",
                          "growth_challenge": "Balancing divine wisdom with the need to allow Francisco and Zara to develop their own inner mastery",
                          "arc_completion": "Transforms into Francisco and Zara's divine mentor, guiding their development as conscious agents of cosmic balance"
                        }
                      },
                      "story_gaps_addressed": {
