                        "mindfulness_power_integration": "Demonstrates how mindfulness practices enhance rather than diminish cosmic abilities",
                        "emotional_regulation_mastery": "Establishes emotional mastery as essential for cosmic leadership",
                        "la_signora_true_nature": "Reveals La Signora's divine identity and her role as a goddess of wisdom and direction",
                        "magician_archetype_development": "Shows Francisco and Zara developing the conscious will direction of the Magician archetype",
                        "purpose_driven_leadership": "Establishes clear purpose and 'why' as essential foundations for cosmic service"
                      },
                      "location_details": {
                        "Sacred_Grove_of_Mindfulness": {
                          "realm": "The Academy's most sacred space, where the boundary between the physical and divine realms is thinnest",
                          "architecture": "An ancient grove with towering trees whose leaves shimmer with cosmic awareness, centered around a crystal-clear pool that reflects infinite realities",
