                      "blue": "0",
                      "major_task_group_title": "Equilibrium",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Equilibrium is the state of balance, harmony, and well-being that enables individuals to thrive and flourish in all areas of life. It involves aligning one's mind, body, and spirit, while cultivating a sense of peace, joy, and fulfillment. Equilibrium is the foundation of health, happiness, and vitality, empowering individuals to live with purpose, passion, and presence. By cultivating equilibrium within oneself and with others, individuals can create a harmonious and holistic lifestyle that enables them to achieve balance and well-being. The state of balance, harmony, and well-being that enables individuals to thrive and flourish in all areas of life.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Equilibrium is the state of balance, harmony, and well-being that enables individuals to thrive and flourish in all areas of life.",
