                      "major_task_group_title": "Strategy",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Strategy is the art of planning, organizing, and executing actions to achieve specific goals, objectives, and outcomes. It involves aligning one's resources, capabilities, and competencies with external opportunities and threats, while adapting to changing circumstances, environments, and conditions. Strategy is the foundation of personal growth, professional development, and lifelong learning. By cultivating strategy within oneself and with others, individuals can create a purposeful and meaningful life that enables them to thrive and flourish. The art of planning, organizing, and executing actions to achieve specific goals, objectives, and outcomes.",
