                      "major_task_group_title": "Fulfillment",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Fulfillment is the act of joy, happiness, and contentment that inspires individuals to seek fulfillment, meaning, and purpose. It involves embracing virtues, values, and beliefs that reflect joy, happiness, and contentment. Fulfillment is the foundation of personal growth, professional development, and lifelong learning. By cultivating fulfillment within oneself and with others, individuals can create a purposeful and meaningful life that enables them to thrive and flourish. The act of joy, happiness, and contentment that inspires individuals to seek fulfillment, meaning, and purpose.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Fulfillment is the act of joy, happiness, and contentment that inspires individuals to seek fulfillment, meaning, and purpose.",
                      "major_task_group_books_influenced_by": {
