              "business_model_you": "Who I help",
              "tagline": "Become the protector of trust and integrity, shaping relationships through compassion and vigilance.",
              "logline": "Uncover the strategies and compassionate practices needed to safeguard trust, protect relationships, and foster a sense of safety in both personal and professional spheres.",
              "description": "Guardians of Trust is a book that explores the concept of protection through the lens of purposeful compassion. It delves into the importance of building trust, ensuring safety, and fostering secure relationships through proactive measures and understanding. The book follows the journey of individuals who navigate the complexities of protection with compassion, transparency, and vigilance, highlighting the significance of trust and security in personal and professional relationships.",
