                          "plot": "Guardians and Gatekeepers",
                          "character_arcs": {
                            "Francisco": "Learning to appreciate the gift of timeline sight rather than focusing on its burdens. Growing in wisdom and empathy.",
                            "Timeline_Travelers": "Various characters from different eras who've been displaced by temporal manipulation, each with their own tragic or triumphant story.",
