                          "story_gaps_addressed": {
                            "world_geography": "Introduction of the Timeline Terminal system - way stations between realities where travelers can rest and resupply.",
                            "temporal_mechanics": "Reveals that timeline travel is addictive - travelers can become lost in exploring alternate versions of their lives.",
                            "character_motivation": "Francisco's growing gratitude for his experiences helps him resist the temptation to escape into better timelines."
