                      "major_task_group_title": "Reflection",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Reflection is the deliberate process of turning inward to examine thoughts, experiences, and emotions. By engaging in honest self-assessment, individuals gain deeper insights into their motivations and behaviors, paving the way for better decision-making, emotional well-being, and meaningful personal growth. Cultivating regular moments of introspection fosters clarity of mind, strengthens values-based living, and nurtures resilience in an ever-changing world.",
