                          "plot": "The Road of Trials",
                          "character_arcs": {
                            "Francisco": "Learning the virtue of patience and the danger of rushing to use power. Beginning to understand that timing is as important as capability.",
                            "Temporal_Monks": "Guardians of timeline stability who've chosen to observe rather than intervene, teaching Francisco about the discipline of restraint.",
