                      "major_task_group_title": "(Partner) Unity",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Unity in partnerships involves coming together under a shared vision, fostering collaboration, and nurturing mutual support. By aligning resources, perspectives, and efforts, partners are able to create a sense of cohesion that drives progress and empowers each individual within the group. Embracing unity establishes trust, encourages creative solutions, and bolsters collective resilience in the face of challenges.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Leveraging collective strength through aligned vision and collaboration.",
