                          "hero_journey_beat": "Crossing the Threshold",
                          "hero_journey_beat_objective": "The goal of this beat is for Francisco to step fully into his new role as a temporal leader, leaving behind his identity as student and follower to embrace responsibility for multiple timelines and unite the fractured factions under a shared vision of stewardship.",
                          "save_the_cat_beat": "Break into Two",
                          "save_the_cat_beat_goal": "Launch Francisco and the allied timeline factions into the 'upside-down world' of unified temporal stewardship, where the rules and stakes are permanently higher, collective responsibility replaces individual ambition, and the true antagonist's manipulations begin to surface.",
                          "plot": "Crossing the Threshold",
                          "character_arcs": {
