                      "major_task_group_title": "Harmony",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Harmony centers on the balanced integration of diverse elements—be they personal, societal, or environmental—into a state of mutual respect and cooperation. By fostering harmony, individuals and communities cultivate understanding, reduce conflict, and build supportive networks that encourage collective flourishing. Emphasizing collaboration, empathy, and holistic thinking allows for deeper connections and sustainable resolutions to life’s challenges.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Harmony unites diverse elements into a peaceful, collaborative rhythm.",
                      "major_task_group_books_influenced_by": {
                        "book1": "Nonviolent Communication by Marshall B. Rosenberg",
