                              "author": "Nassim Nicholas Taleb",
                              "section_of_focus": "Benefiting from Disorder",
                              "section_description": "Explores how some systems gain strength through volatility and stressors rather than merely resisting them.",
                              "connection_focus_area": "Shows how deliberate exposure to small challenges can build lasting robustness and adaptability.",
                              "connect_points": {
