                          "hero_journey_beat": "Tests, Allies, Enemies",
                          "hero_journey_beat_objective": "The goal of the hero journey beat is to guardians and gatekeepers.",
                          "save_the_cat_beat": "Fun and Games",
                          "save_the_cat_beat_goal": "Test Francisco's new leadership and the Unity Council's cohesion by presenting a threat that cannot be met with force, but only with adaptability—the core lesson of the Seven of Swords.",
                          "plot": "Guardians and Gatekeepers: The newly formed Unity Council faces its first asymmetrical threat—agents of Dagon who use the factions' own rigidity against them.",
