                      "major_task_group_title": "Strong Leadership",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Strong Leadership focuses on guiding teams, communities, and organizations with clarity, decisiveness, and a commitment to ethical principles. By fostering trust, setting a clear vision, and inspiring others to perform at their best, leaders help unify efforts toward shared goals. Strong leaders balance assertiveness with empathy, adaptability, and accountability, ensuring that their leadership remains sustainable and growth-oriented.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Empowering teams through decisive, ethical, and visionary leadership.",
                      "major_task_group_books_influenced_by": {
