                        "book4": "Good to Great by Jim Collins",
                        "book5": "Multipliers by Liz Wiseman",
                        "book6": "Dare to Lead by Brené Brown",
                        "book7": "Primal Leadership by Daniel Goleman, Richard Boyatzis, and Annie McKee"
