                          "plot": "The Descent: The physical battle pauses, but the internal battle begins. Francisco must face his own doubts in the quiet of the aftermath (Queen of Cups).",
                          "character_arcs": {
                            "Francisco": "Shifts from 'Man of Action' to 'Man of Wisdom'. Learns that silence is as powerful as speech.",
