                          "save_the_cat_beat_goal": "Operationalize the 'Wild Idea' from EA-067 using 'Methodical' precision to survive the 'Dark Night of the Soul'.",
                          "plot": "The Abyss: The idea is approved, but the execution is impossible. Francisco must become the King of Swords—ruthlessly logical—to break the plan into 1000 executable steps. The 'Checklist' saves them.",
                          "character_arcs": {
                            "Francisco": "Integrates the 'King of Swords'. Becomes a master of logistics and detail, balancing his 'Wands' passion.",
