                      "major_task_group_title": "Ethical Growth",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Ethical Growth involves the continual refining of one's moral compass to navigate complex social, personal, and professional challenges. By striving to align daily actions with deeply held principles, individuals cultivate a sense of integrity, empathy, and moral responsibility that supports both individual flourishing and the betterment of society.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Elevating our moral compass to foster integrity and collective well-being.",
