                          "plot": "The Ultimate Boon: The immediate threat is gone, but the cost was high. Francisco leads the physical and spiritual rebuilding, proving that 'Resilience' is not just enduring, but improving.",
                          "character_arcs": {
                            "Francisco": "Integrates the 'Nine of Wands'. He is tired, bandaged, but vigilant. He learns to rest without losing readiness.",
