                      "major_task_group_title": "Civic Virtue",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Civic Virtue underscores the importance of responsible citizenship and collective well-being. By engaging actively in civic life—whether through community service, informed voting, or public discourse—individuals strengthen societal bonds, promote ethical governance, and nurture a shared sense of responsibility. Emphasizing the common good above personal interest cultivates trust, cohesion, and long-term stability within communities.",
