                          "plot": "The Flight (Part 1): The Redoubt is besieged by Dagon's new offensive. Francisco needs to move the Council to safety. The only path is through the territory of the 'Grey Traders', who hate them. He must use Generosity (Six of Disks) to buy passage, not with bribes, but with genuine aid.",
