                      "major_task_group_title": "Energy",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Energy represents the driving force that motivates action, sparks creativity, and sustains momentum in personal and professional endeavors. By cultivating both physical vigor and mental stamina, individuals can remain adaptable, inspired, and determined in the face of challenges. Harnessing energy effectively enables continuous growth, fosters resilience, and propels individuals toward their goals with focus and enthusiasm.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Channeling vibrant force to fuel progress and generate transformative outcomes.",
                      "major_task_group_books_influenced_by": {
