                      "major_task_group_title": "Self-Mastery",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Self-Mastery involves taking ownership of one’s thoughts, emotions, and behaviors to achieve greater personal growth and well-being. By developing discipline, emotional intelligence, and a clear sense of purpose, individuals cultivate the resilience and confidence necessary to navigate life’s challenges. Emphasizing consistent self-awareness, Self-Mastery fosters a sense of integrity, adaptability, and balanced self-leadership.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Harnessing inner discipline for sustained personal growth and purposeful living.",
