                          "plot": "Resolution: The Rescue ships arrive. The siege is broken. But the timeline is collapsing. They must run the gauntlet to the extraction point. Francisco wakes up (from EA-078) and leads the sprint. It is pure momentum (Eight of Wands).",
                          "character_arcs": {
