                          "save_the_cat_beat_goal": "Establish the 'Ordinary World' of Book 3 with Francisco's new 'Radiance' (Ace of Wands) attracting both awe and danger.",
                          "plot": "Book 3 Opener: The Magus returns. Francisco is back in Bologna. He has integrated the lessons of Books 1 & 2. He radiates power (Ace of Wands). He is teaching at the University, but his lectures are... different. He is starting a new fire. Novella watches him, seeing the 'Shining One' overlaying the man.",
                          "character_arcs": {
                            "Francisco": "The Teacher. He is confident, charismatic, but slightly detached. He risks becoming 'The Guru'.",
                            "Novella": "The Grounding Wire. She keeps him connected to reality.",
                            "Cardinal_Colonna": "The Observer. He sees the potential weapon in Francisco."
                          },
                          "story_gaps_addressed": {
                            "magical_progression": "Shows how much stronger he is since Book 1.",
                            "social_status": "He is no longer a student; he is a force of nature."
                          },
                          "location_details": {
                            "the_lecture_hall": "Dusty, wood-paneled, filled with mesmerized students.",
