                          "plot": "Inciting Incident: The carriage arrives. Francisco is taken to the Colonna Palace. The Cardinal plays the 'Two of Wands'—holding the world in one hand and a wand in the other. He offers Francisco dominion over history, but under Church rule. It is a disruption of Francisco's independent path. He must choose his future.",
