                          "save_the_cat_beat_goal": "Undergo 'Introspection' (Eight of Cups): Francisco walks away from his safe life to prepare for his dangerous double-agent role.",
                          "plot": "The Setup: Before he goes to Colonna, Francisco must 'clean house'. He realizes his current life—the cups stacked neatly—is emotional baggage he can't carry. The Eight of Cups moment: turning his back on fulfillment to seek a higher/harder truth. He visits his favorite spots in Bologna one last time.",
