                          "save_the_cat_beat_goal": "Experience the 'Apathy' (Four of Cups) of the emotional crash after the sacrifice, requiring a new spark to reengage.",
                          "plot": "Reaction (Part 2): Weeks later. Francisco is hiding in a safe house. The adrenaline is gone. He is depressed, staring at a wall. The Four of Cups: three cups offered (past accomplishments), one cup offered by a hand in the cloud (the new mission), but he refuses to look up. La Signora tries to engage him, but he is numb.",
