                      "major_task_group_title": "Wisdom",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Wisdom is the art of integrating knowledge, experience, and clear judgment to see beyond appearances and make choices that reflect deep understanding. By uniting critical thinking with empathy and self-awareness, wisdom allows individuals to discern what truly matters in complex situations. Cultivating wisdom leads to more enlightened actions, authentic connections, and a sense of purpose that resonates within both personal and communal spheres.",
