                          "plot": "Refusal of the Call (The Pivot): Francisco escapes the trial but realizes he isn't alone. The paradox from EA-087 displaced a family (Refugees). He can't leave them. He charters a boat to take them downriver to a sanctuary. The Six of Swords imagery: calm travel, carrying baggage (the refugees/past). He teaches them to breathe through the temporal sickness. He finds his own calm.",
