                      "major_task_group_title": "Liberation",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Liberation signifies the breaking of internal and external constraints that limit human potential and growth. It encompasses freeing oneself from oppressive beliefs, circumstances, or power structures, allowing individuals to reclaim their agency. By embracing liberation, we cultivate the courage and clarity to confront injustice, transcend self-imposed limitations, and step into a wider realm of possibility—both personally and collectively.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Transcending barriers to embrace freedom, growth, and boundless possibility.",
