                          "plot": "Allies/Fun and Games: The scroll from EA-091 reveals a supply route. Francisco leads a raid (the 'Courage' pays off). They capture the wagons without killing (Win-Win). They bring the food back to the Sanctuary. The mood shifts from grim survival to 'Abundance.' They feast. The Three of Cups—toasts, friendship, shared joy. Francisco sees that his 'Removal' decision (EA-090) saved the core, and now 'Abundance' feeds them.",
