                      "major_task_group_title": "(Create) Illumination",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Illumination here refers to shedding light on the core truths and hidden potential that guide us forward. By creating moments of clarity—through insights, innovation, and deliberate reflection—we illuminate new possibilities and foster a richer, more purposeful engagement with the world. Emphasizing creativity and vision, creating illumination energizes collective progress and reveals solutions lurking just beyond the familiar.",
