                          "plot": "Crossing the Threshold: Francisco realizes the abundance and courage of the group are wasted without structure. He channels the 'Hierophant'—the Teacher/Pope. He codifies their knowledge. He writes the 'Codex Aeternum' (or a draft). He initiates his 12 followers into the secrets of time, 'Illuminating' their minds. They cross the threshold from a band of rebels to an Order.",
