                  "title": "Interconnection",
                  "tagline": "The web of relationships that binds us together.",
                  "description": "Interconnection is the web of relationships that binds us together. It involves recognizing the interconnectedness of all things and understanding how our actions impact others. By fostering interconnection, individuals can build strong relationships and create a sense of community that supports collective growth and success.",
                  "fiction_novel_section_title": "Children of the Voice",
                  "fiction_novel_section_description": "In 'Children of the Voice,' an ancient civilization uses a mysterious resonance to link every living being, forging unity in a world once marked by strife. When these links weaken, individuals from disparate backgrounds must come together to restore the ‘Voices’ that harmonize their society. Along the way, they learn that the power of genuine interconnection transcends differences, uniting communities to overcome daunting odds.",
                  "fiction_novel_section_tagline": "When every voice resonates in harmony, the bonds of interconnection spark hope and possibility.",
                  "fiction_novel_section_books_influenced_by": {
                    "book1": "Cloud Atlas by David Mitchell",
                    "book2": "The Overstory by Richard Powers",
                    "book3": "One Hundred Years of Solitude by Gabriel García Márquez",
                    "book4": "Station Eleven by Emily St. John Mandel",
                    "book5": "The Left Hand of Darkness by Ursula K. Le Guin",
                    "book6": "The Broken Earth Trilogy (The Fifth Season) by N.K. Jemisin",
                    "book7": "Dune by Frank Herbert"
                  },
