                          "plot": "Fun and Games: The Vatican sends 'Inquisitor M.', a strategist who doesn't use brute force but traps. He lays a magical snare in the forest. Francisco almost falls for it but uses 'Mental Agility.' He sees the pattern change. He pivots. He directs the team to use the environment (the river, the wind) against the magic. It's a battle of wits. The Page of Swords—energetic, cutting, quick.",
