                      "major_task_group_description": "Strategic Excellence emphasizes the creation, execution, and continuous refinement of informed, long-range plans. By combining analytical thinking, foresight, and adaptability, individuals and organizations can navigate uncertainty and secure a competitive advantage. Fostering strategic excellence means not only responding effectively to immediate challenges, but also proactively shaping future opportunities—balancing data-driven insights with intuition, creativity, and ethical considerations to build sustainable success.",
