                          "plot": "Bad Guys Close In (Internal): The victory of EA-097 turns sour. Francisco locks himself in his study to design the 'Extraction Spell.' This is the Ace of Swords—pure, cutting intellect. He stops eating. He ignores the Refugee Mother's plea for help with food supplies. He snaps at La Signora. 'Focus' becomes 'Obsession.' He solves the magical problem, but the social cost is high. The Order feels abandoned by their leader.",
