                          "summary": "Days pass. Francisco is a ghost. The Ace of Swords demands total clarify. He achieves 'Deep Work,' but it is toxic. He figures out how to bypass the Keystone's ward. La Signora breaks down his door. 'We are starving,' she says (metaphorically and literally). He looks at her with cold eyes. 'I am saving the world. Eat less.' It is a shocking moment of cruelty born of 'Focus.' He has the spell, but he may have lost the people.",
