                          "plot": "All is Lost (Setup): Before the big crash, there is the grind. The Eight of Disks is the card of apprenticeship and detail. The Order prepares for the Keystone extraction based on Francisco's spell (EA-098). It involves 'Ambition'—not just wanting the prize, but doing the hard work to get it. They forge gear. They memorize routes. They practice the extraction. Francisco drives them. His ambition lifts them up, but also wears them down. They are ready, but exhausted.",
