                              "pages": "Page 342 - 345",
                              "description": "As the visions crystallize into clarity, Francisco understands he is not meant to single-handedly save the future—but to be one of many guides helping humanity navigate toward its creative potential. The vision-space releases him, and he returns to the Chamber of Echoes transformed. Zara finds him at dawn, and though he cannot fully articulate what he has seen, his eyes carry new depth. He knows the path forward with renewed purpose.",
