                      "major_task_group_title": "Historical Perspective",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Historical Perspective involves examining the past to gain insight into present conditions and future possibilities. By studying patterns of societal change, innovation, conflict, and collaboration, individuals can develop deeper context for decision-making and cultivate empathy toward different cultures, eras, and ideologies. Emphasizing a long-term view encourages informed judgments and strengthens one’s ability to adapt and lead responsibly.",
