                            "positive_transformation": "His vision of healing and harmony sets up the hopeful resolution of the series."
                          },
                          "summary": "From the crucible of surrender and apparent defeat, Francisco conceives his greatest vision yet - a new way of relating to temporal power that could transform humanity's relationship with time itself. This conception represents the birth of a transformative future that could heal the wounds created by temporal warfare and create lasting peace.",
                          "pov": "3rd Person Limited",
