                      "major_task_group_title": "Harmonious Leadership",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Harmonious Leadership emphasizes leading with empathy, collaboration, and a unifying vision. By nurturing mutual respect, open dialogue, and shared commitment to core values, leaders create inclusive environments where diverse talents thrive. Drawing on emotional intelligence and conflict-resolution skills, Harmonious Leadership seeks balance between organizational aims and collective well-being, enabling resilient teams that can adapt and grow together.",
