                            {
                              "scene_number": 1,
                              "title": "The Hearth Restored",
                              "setup": "Exhausted from cosmic visions and revolutionary work, Francisco discovers profound healing in the simple act of preparing a shared meal with his community",
                              "symbolism": "Ten of Cups overflowing—emotional fulfillment found through basic human connection and domestic ritual",
                              "beat_goal": "Establish the healing power of simple rituals and domestic activities as essential counterbalance to cosmic work",
                              "pov": "3rd Person Limited",
                              "tense": "Past Tense",
                              "core_emotion": "Weary gratitude transforming into gentle joy",
                              "scene_tone": "Warm, intimate, restorative",
                              "pages": "Page 391 - 395",
                              "description": "In the modest kitchen of their rebuilt quarters, Francisco finds himself drawn to the simple ritual of preparing bread. His hands, so recently wielding cosmic forces, now knead dough with the same attention. Zara joins him, then others—each adding their own contributions to the shared meal. The Ten of Cups manifests not in grand triumph but in these quiet moments: flour-dusted hands, the scent of rising bread, stories exchanged over chopping vegetables. Francisco discovers that this ordinary magic restores something the cosmic work depletes—basic human groundedness.",
                              "focus": "Discovering that domestic rituals and simple pleasures provide essential emotional restoration after intense cosmic work",
                              "chapterSceneFocus": "Ch107S1: Francisco finds healing and joy in preparing a shared meal, reconnecting with basic humanity",
                              "preliminarySceneFocus": "Restorative power of simple rituals",
                              "preliminarySceneDescription": "Ten of Cups energy manifests through domestic activities—cooking, eating together, sharing mundane stories—revealing that cosmic work requires grounding in simple human pleasures",
                              "sensoryDetail": "Warm kitchen filled with bread's yeasty aroma, flour soft between fingers, rhythm of kneading meditative and grounding, sound of gentle laughter and ordinary conversation, taste of simple food made extraordinary by shared presence, evening light golden through kitchen windows creating domestic sanctuary",
                              "internalConflict": "Francisco's sense that this is 'wasting time' when cosmic work demands attention warring with recognition that without this grounding he will burn out and lose his humanity",
                              "characterGrowthElement": "Francisco learning that maintaining human connection and simple joys is not distraction from cosmic work but essential foundation for sustainable service",
                              "seriesConnectionResonance": "Establishes that Francisco's ultimate effectiveness comes from maintaining balance between cosmic vision and human groundedness, foreshadowing need for this balance in final books",
                              "sceneCardProgression": 318,
                              "realWorldContext": "11/28/1347 Evening—two days after the sacred vow, needing restoration before next phase",
                              "timelineSignificance": "Moment when Francisco learns that cosmic work requires grounding in basic human activities to remain sustainable and authentic",
                              "saveTheCatBeat": "Trials setup - establishing balance before challenges",
                              "narrative_function": "Grounding and restoration establishing sustainable rhythm for cosmic work",
                              "timeline_date": "11/28/1347 - Evening of Simple Joys",
                              "timeline_variant": "Baseline Reality (Francisco's home timeline)",
                              "location": "Community Kitchen, Rebuilt Quarters, Bologna",
