                              "preliminarySceneDescription": "Francisco leads sanctuary-building that addresses not just physical shelter but emotional and spiritual needs through intentional design and ritual establishment",
                              "sensoryDetail": "Courtyard transformation: soft lantern light replacing harsh glare, cushions and blankets creating nests of comfort, herb scents (lavender, chamomile) calming frayed nerves, sounds of gentle fountain replacing battle echoes, textures chosen for tactile comfort, spaces that invite both gathering and solitude",
                              "internalConflict": "Francisco's awareness that enemies still threaten balanced against conviction that maintaining sanctuary is resistance itself, fear this is 'retreat' versus understanding it's essential fortification",
