                              "saveTheCatBeat": "Trials setup - establishing renewed foundation for challenges",
                              "narrative_function": "Transformation and renewal establishing sustainable foundation for cosmic work",
                              "timeline_date": "12/01/1347 - Twilight of Renewed Foundation",
