                          "summary": "Rallying his weary allies who have grown dispirited by continued setbacks, Francisco learns to call forth dormant passions and unite fractured voices in a shared cause. His ability to inspire renewed commitment and enthusiasm becomes crucial for maintaining resistance against seemingly overwhelming opposition.",
                          "pov": "3rd Person Limited",
