                          "core_emotion": "Varies by scene context",
                          "scene_tone": "Reflective and purposeful",
                          "scenes": [
                            {
                              "scene_number": 1,
                              "title": "Dormant Fires Rekindled",
                              "setup": "Francisco encounters his weary allies losing hope after prolonged setbacks, and despite his own exhaustion, must find a way to awaken their dormant passion for the cause",
                              "symbolism": "Embers stirred to flame—dormant fire within allies that needs only the right spark to reignite",
                              "beat_goal": "Establish the crisis of waning commitment and Francisco's discovery of how to rekindle passion in others",
                              "pov": "3rd Person Limited",
                              "tense": "Past Tense",
                              "core_emotion": "Exhausted determination transforming into inspired energy",
                              "scene_tone": "Heavy turning hopeful, weary becoming energized",
                              "pages": "Page 406 - 410",
                              "description": "In the assembly hall, Francisco faces his allies and sees what he's been dreading—eyes dulled by prolonged struggle, shoulders slumped under accumulated defeats. They gather not with enthusiasm but from habit. Yet as he speaks, sharing not polished rhetoric but honest acknowledgment of their exhaustion alongside vision of why it matters, something shifts. He reminds them not just of what they fight against but what they fight for—the future glimpsed in his visions, the sanctuary they've created, the harmonic approach that could transform everything. One by one, dormant fires rekindle. Not through denial of weariness but through remembering purpose deeper than fatigue.",
                              "focus": "Francisco learning to inspire renewal not through false optimism but through honest acknowledgment plus compelling vision",
                              "chapterSceneFocus": "Ch108S1: Francisco rekindles allies' dormant passion by combining authentic recognition of struggle with transformative vision",
                              "preliminarySceneFocus": "Awakening passion through authentic leadership",
                              "preliminarySceneDescription": "Six of Wands energy begins to manifest as Francisco discovers his power to awaken commitment in others—not through manipulation but through authentic connection to shared purpose",
                              "sensoryDetail": "Assembly hall dim with low energy, faces showing bone-deep weariness, Francisco's voice raw with his own exhaustion making it authentic, sudden shift as first person sits straighter, energy rippling through room like wind through embers, sounds of renewed determination—sharper breathing, bodies leaning forward, voices finding strength again",
                              "internalConflict": "Francisco's own exhaustion threatening to undermine his message warring with recognition that his authenticity about struggle is precisely what makes his hope credible, fear he has nothing left to give versus discovering that shared purpose replenishes rather than depletes",
                              "characterGrowthElement": "Francisco discovering that inspirational leadership comes not from superhuman energy but from authentic connection—his exhaustion acknowledged makes his hope more powerful, not less",
                              "seriesConnectionResonance": "Establishes Francisco's capacity to inspire collective action crucial for Books 7-9, showing leadership that sustains movements through dark times by honoring struggle while maintaining vision",
                              "sceneCardProgression": 321,
                              "realWorldContext": "12/03/1347 Morning—after several days of mounting discouragement, crucial rally point",
                              "timelineSignificance": "Moment when Francisco learns to lead not from untouchable strength but from authentic shared struggle, making his leadership sustainable and his movement resilient",
                              "saveTheCatBeat": "Pinch/Dark Night - crisis of commitment threatening movement",
                              "narrative_function": "Crisis and renewal establishing Francisco's authentic inspirational leadership",
                              "timeline_date": "12/03/1347 - Morning of Rekindling",
                              "timeline_variant": "Baseline Reality (Francisco's home timeline)",
                              "location": "Assembly Hall, Bologna",
                              "sudowrite_metadata": {
                                "intensity": "building",
                                "pacing": "slow_gathering_momentum",
