                                "emotional_arc": "shared_exhaustion_transforming_into_renewed_commitment"
                              },
                              "learning_objectives": [
                                "Inspirational leadership requires authentic acknowledgment of struggle, not denial or false optimism",
                                "Shared purpose replenishes energy rather than depleting it when connection is genuine",
                                "Dormant passion needs only the right spark—reminder of deep purpose—to reignite"
                              ],
                              "foreshadowing_elements": [
