                                "This rally demonstrates the power that will enable mass mobilization in Books 7-9",
                                "Technique of acknowledging struggle while maintaining vision becomes template for sustaining movements"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "scene_number": 2,
                              "title": "Voices United",
                              "setup": "With passion rekindled, Francisco faces the challenge of uniting fractured groups with different perspectives and approaches into a cohesive movement around shared purpose",
                              "symbolism": "Discord resolving into harmony—diverse voices finding their place in shared song",
                              "beat_goal": "Develop Francisco's practice of creating unity while honoring diversity, bringing together fractured allies",
                              "pov": "3rd Person Limited",
                              "tense": "Past Tense",
                              "core_emotion": "Purposeful bridge-building with patient determination",
                              "scene_tone": "Diplomatic, integrative, increasingly harmonious",
                              "pages": "Page 411 - 415",
                              "description": "Francisco gathers representatives from fractured factions—temporal scholars who prioritize research, activists demanding immediate action, sanctuary-builders focused on safety, visionaries pursuing transformation. Each sees their approach as essential, others' as distraction. Rather than imposing unity, Francisco facilitates a process where each voice articulates not just their method but their underlying why. Gradually they discover all serve the same deep purpose through different necessary roles. He shows how temporal harmony requires all these approaches—research informing action, sanctuary enabling sustainability, vision providing direction. The Six of Wands energy manifests as they recognize they're already a movement, just needed someone to help them see it.",
                              "focus": "Francisco's skill at creating unity by revealing how diverse approaches serve shared deeper purpose",
                              "chapterSceneFocus": "Ch108S2: Francisco unites fractured groups by facilitating recognition of shared purpose beneath different methods",
                              "preliminarySceneFocus": "Unity through honoring diversity",
                              "preliminarySceneDescription": "Francisco demonstrates sophisticated leadership—creating cohesion not through homogenization but by helping diverse groups see how their different contributions serve the same transformative vision",
                              "sensoryDetail": "Circle of diverse representatives initially sitting with crossed arms, physical distance between factions, Francisco's patient facilitation creating space for each voice, gradual shift as bodies lean inward, defensive postures softening, eventual moment when someone from one faction spontaneously acknowledges value of another's approach, sound of genuine dialogue replacing defensive arguing",
                              "internalConflict": "Francisco's impatience with process warring with understanding that authentic unity can't be rushed, temptation to impose his vision versus commitment to facilitate genuine co-creation, doubt whether diverse groups can truly align versus faith in shared deeper purpose",
                              "characterGrowthElement": "Francisco evolving from visionary who knows the answer to leader who facilitates collective wisdom, learning that sustainable movements require all members to own the vision, not just follow his",
                              "seriesConnectionResonance": "This unity-building practice becomes essential for Books 7-9 when Francisco must coordinate global cooperation across vastly different cultures and perspectives for cosmic transformation",
                              "sceneCardProgression": 322,
                              "realWorldContext": "12/03/1347 Afternoon—intensive unity-building session following morning's inspiration",
                              "timelineSignificance": "Establishment of inclusive leadership approach that makes Francisco's movement genuinely collective rather than cult of personality, ensuring its sustainability beyond him",
                              "saveTheCatBeat": "Pinch - working through conflict toward unity",
                              "narrative_function": "Unity building establishing inclusive movement structure and collective leadership",
                              "timeline_date": "12/03/1347 - Afternoon of Unity",
