                      "major_task_group_title": "Inspirational Leadership",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Inspirational Leadership involves guiding others through vision, empathy, and genuine passion. By cultivating trust, authentic communication, and a clear sense of mission, leaders can ignite motivation and resilience within a team. Inspirational leaders model integrity, foster creativity, and create environments where individuals feel empowered to contribute their unique strengths to shared goals. The result is a collective sense of purpose that elevates both performance and morale.",
