                          "summary": "At his lowest ebb, when all seems lost and his allies are scattered or captured, Francisco's spirit steels itself against despair. He discovers the inner wellspring of endurance that will carry him forward no matter what obstacles arise. This endurance becomes not just personal strength but a model for others facing their own dark nights.",
