                          "summary": "Armed with his spiritual transformation and renewed authority, Francisco begins entrusting critical tasks to his most loyal allies. He learns to weave unity through shared purpose by giving others meaningful roles in the mission. This delegation represents his growing trust in others and his evolution from individual hero to collective leader.",
