                      "major_task_group_description": "Strategic Acumen underscores the skillful application of foresight, data analysis, and adaptive thinking to guide long-term success. By marrying creativity with pragmatism, individuals and organizations can better identify risks, seize opportunities, and coordinate effective actions. Cultivating strategic acumen requires not only rational planning but also emotional intelligence, ethical judgment, and the ability to navigate complex, evolving environments with confidence and vision.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Forging a clear path forward through forward-thinking insight and dynamic planning.",
                      "major_task_group_books_influenced_by": {
