                        "book4": "Playing to Win by A.G. Lafley and Roger L. Martin",
                        "book5": "Range by David Epstein",
                        "book6": "Decisive by Chip Heath and Dan Heath",
                        "book7": "The 33 Strategies of War by Robert Greene"
