                                "Influence principles and intrinsic motivation frameworks provide systematic approach to understanding human behavior without reducing people to mere patterns",
                                "Strategic awareness and compassion complement rather than conflict—seeing people's self-interest clearly while honoring their full humanity creates wise engagement"
