                            {
                              "scene_number": 2,
                              "title": "Shared Vision Healing",
                              "setup": "Francisco and La Signora combine their complementary abilities to heal the rifts between temporal factions that have developed during the conflict—discovering that their partnership creates capacity neither possesses alone, demonstrating the power of kindred spirits working in aligned purpose",
                              "symbolism": "Two streams merging into mighty river—individual flows combining to create force capable of transforming landscape, partnership as multiplication rather than addition",
                              "beat_goal": "Demonstrate how Francisco and La Signora's partnership creates healing capacity beyond individual range, establishing their collaborative power",
                              "pov": "3rd Person Limited",
                              "tense": "Past Tense",
                              "core_emotion": "Collaborative power, unified purpose manifesting",
                              "scene_tone": "Harmonious and powerful, multiplication through union",
                              "pages": "Page 561 - 565",
                              "description": "The battle has left fractures—not just physical but relational. Temporal mage factions that fought together now eye each other with suspicion born of stress. Mystical practitioners and academic scholars have retreated to familiar camps. The coalition Francisco built seems to be fragmenting in victory's aftermath. Alone, he could perhaps mediate specific conflicts, but the systemic healing required exceeds individual capacity. This is where partnership reveals its power. La Signora brings gifts Francisco lacks: her connection to temporal factions outside Bologna, her authority within mystical circles, her capacity to see patterns across multiple timelines simultaneously. Francisco offers what complements her strengths: his proven collaborative leadership, his hard-won diplomatic wisdom, his authentic relationships with this specific community. Together, they design what Parker would call a purpose-driven gathering—not mere meeting but intentional space for genuine reconnection. They don't just invite faction leaders; they create container where competing groups can remember shared purpose that united them. Drawing on Heath and Heath's power of moments, they design defining experiences that shift perception. When temporal mages from different schools see La Signora and Francisco working in perfect synchronization—her temporal sight revealing patterns, his collaborative facilitation integrating diverse perspectives—they witness what partnership makes possible. When mystical practitioners observe how academic precision and spiritual depth complement rather than contradict, they experience integration that seemed impossible. The healing emerges not through Francisco or La Signora separately but through their partnership demonstrating a possibility others haven't seen: that different approaches, different gifts, different perspectives don't require choosing sides but can integrate into something more powerful than any single approach. Their combined work addresses what neither could alone: Francisco's community trust enabling access La Signora lacks, La Signora's broader perspective providing context Francisco missed, together creating both immediate healing and sustainable framework. By scene's end, the factions aren't perfectly unified—but they've seen and experienced a new paradigm. The rifts begin healing not through forced agreement but through recognition that diversity of approach serves shared purpose better than uniformity. Francisco and La Signora's partnership becomes living proof: two very different individuals with complementary gifts creating through union what neither could manifest separately.",
                              "focus": "Francisco and La Signora's collaborative healing work demonstrating partnership multiplication, creating capacity beyond individual range",
