                              "sensoryDetail": "The gathering space carefully designed for purpose-driven connection; faction leaders arriving with suspicion yielding to curiosity; Francisco and La Signora working in seamless synchronization—her temporal sight, his collaborative facilitation; the visual of different groups witnessing integration they thought impossible; the sound of conversations shifting from defensive to curious; the texture of rifts beginning to heal—not forced unity but authentic recognition of shared purpose; the power of defining moments shifting perception; the quality of partnership multiplication—capacity emerging that neither alone possesses; the warmth spreading as community remembers what united them; the recognition that diversity serves shared purpose better than uniformity",
                              "internalConflict": "Francisco's awareness of limits his individual capacity can't address warring with trust in partnership's multiplication—his instinct to solve everything himself versus acceptance that some work requires collaborative gifts, his vulnerability in acknowledging what he alone cannot do versus strength in partnership that transcends individual limits",
