                      "major_task_group_title": "Enlightened Realism",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Enlightened Realism embraces the synthesis of high ideals and grounded practicality, encouraging individuals to dream boldly while remaining anchored in reality. By aligning vision with feasible action steps, people can create meaningful, impactful solutions rather than falling into naive optimism or cynical pragmatism. Through continuous reflection, learning, and ethical discernment, Enlightened Realism fosters progress that is both inspiring and sustainable.",
