                          "summary": "In a final act of restoration, Francisco channels the communal strengths he has built to heal deep fractures in the temporal realm. He weaves old wounds into renewed promise, demonstrating that the conflicts and divisions of the past can become sources of strength for the future. This restoration sets the stage for the greater challenges ahead.",
