              "tagline": "Learn the art of seeing ahead, turning foresight and planning into your most powerful assets.",
              "logline": "Master the art of anticipation and strategic foresight to ensure success by navigating logistics and operations with precision and emotional intelligence.",
              "description": "The Power of Anticipation is a book that explores the concept of anticipation through the lens of strategic insight. It delves into the importance of anticipating outcomes, balancing emotional sensitivity and practical logistics to achieve long-term success. The book follows the journey of individuals who navigate logistics with strategic insight, highlighting the significance of anticipation and strategic foresight in personal and professional success.",
