                      "major_task_group_title": "Economic Innovation",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Economic Innovation drives prosperity by fostering new ideas, products, and business models that strengthen and diversify markets. Through creativity, entrepreneurship, and strategic investment, societies can spur growth, generate jobs, and elevate living standards. Emphasizing both collaboration and technological advancement, Economic Innovation thrives on adaptability, vision, and continuous improvement to shape a resilient and dynamic future.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Empowering growth through visionary ideas, collaborative strategies, and transformative solutions.",
                      "major_task_group_books_influenced_by": {
