                          "connection_to_the_major_task_group": "Breaking through mental barriers unleashes fresh solutions and propels forward momentum.",
                          "specific_task_group_description": "Breakthroughs guides you to identify and overcome hidden assumptions, adopt radical reframes, and rapidly prototype new ideas.",
