                                "Each member's specialized capability (Zara: protection, Roger: reconnaissance, Dante: documentation, La Signora: sanctuary) becoming series-long roles",
                                "Meta-policy that unity predictable but actions emergent establishing Book 7-9 coordinated timeline operations philosophy",
