                                "Accountability protocols (daily check-ins, weekly vulnerability circles, monthly reassessments) becoming Conscious Collective standard operations",
                                "Francisco's pattern synthesis role coordinating diverse data streams preparing for Book 6-9 multi-timeline analysis",
