                      "major_task_group_title": "Enlightened Empowerment",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Enlightened Empowerment merges personal agency with heightened awareness, guiding individuals to harness their strengths, values, and knowledge ethically and compassionately. By blending critical thinking, self-reflection, and a commitment to both self-improvement and the collective good, Enlightened Empowerment sets the stage for transformative leadership and collaborative progress. Emphasizing the role of empathy and integrity, it inspires people to uplift not just themselves but their communities as well.",
