                      "major_task_group_title": "Moral Philosophy",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Moral Philosophy explores the concepts of right and wrong, justice and fairness, and the principles that guide ethical conduct. By examining various moral theories and their applications, individuals can refine their sense of responsibility, empathy, and principled action. Through a thoughtful understanding of moral frameworks—ranging from utilitarian to deontological, and beyond—people cultivate the ability to make ethical decisions and lead with integrity in personal, professional, and civic spheres.",
