                                "Trust junior leaders with rapid pivots—granting cell leaders decision authority generates faster more creative solutions (10-minute diverse responses) than centralized approval (Willink & Babin: front-line leaders possess local context enabling superior tactical decisions, autonomy releases creativity and speed, trust in competence multiplies organizational capability beyond individual genius)",
