                              "timelineSignificance": "Rebellion's systematic agility (48-hour demonstration surpassing cosmic authorities' deliberative planning) creating strategic inflection—authorities acknowledging organizational transformation requiring counter-strategy debate (overwhelming force versus strategic withdrawal), validation that rebellion achieved genuine capability cosmic authorities cannot match through planning alone, sustainable tactical superiority enabling Books 5-9 sustained resistance.",
