                          "summary": "Burning with urgency to exploit their apparent advantage, Francisco charges into action before receiving full counsel from his advisors. He discovers that bold leaps against cosmic authority must be guided by wisdom and foresight to avoid hidden traps set by divine intelligence. This near-disaster teaches him to balance urgency with prudence.",
                          "pov": "3rd Person Limited",
