                              "learning_objectives": [
                                "Identify decisions suited for quick action—Francisco's archive strike (fast opportunity, familiar pattern appearance) seemed appropriate for System 1 but hidden complexity (trap design) required System 2 (Kahneman: recognize when situation familiar/simple favoring intuition versus unfamiliar/complex requiring analysis, identify indicators suggesting deeper evaluation needed, classify decisions by characteristics determining optimal thinking mode)",
                                "Recognize when deeper analysis is critical—bypassing advisory council (temporal expert Adriana, risk analyst Marcus, pattern specialist Sofia) eliminated safeguards revealing trap (Kahneman: expert deliberate evaluation uncovers dangers intuition misses, unfamiliar high-stakes situations demand System 2 despite time pressure, recognize red flags indicating need for analytical thinking)",
