                      "major_task_group_description": "Hard Won Victory represents the trials, setbacks, and relentless perseverance that ultimately pave the way for meaningful success. Whether through physical endurance, mental fortitude, or moral conviction, triumph is claimed by those who withstand hardship and remain dedicated to growth despite adversity. Emphasizing resilience, focus, and unwavering effort, Hard Won Victory stands as a testament to the power of determination and the transformative impact of emerging stronger from one’s most challenging battles.",
