                          "summary": "After surviving his near-disaster and learning crucial lessons about cosmic rebellion, Francisco takes time to appreciate the value of his experiences and allies. This reflection allows him to weave deeper connections with his supporters and accelerate his evolution toward true mastery of rebellion against fate. He crosses the threshold from reactive rebel to strategic revolutionary.",
                          "pov": "3rd Person Limited",
