                              "chapterSceneFocus": "Ch133S4: Completing threshold crossing via gratitude integration—comprehensive assessment showing systematic appreciation (Kaplan + Emmons + Kralik creating 40% resilience, neurological/physiological/social optimization, trust infrastructure) transforms rebellion from reactive passion to sustainable appreciation-based movement ready long campaign",
