se: emotional volatility decreasing 45% (measured self-reports), adaptive creativity increasing (members generating innovative solutions under pressure rather freezing), psychological resilience deepening (difficult emotions becoming navigation tools not obstacles). London Hue fully manifesting: strategic maturity recognizing true strength includes emotional sophistication—rigid stoicism fragile, flexible emotional navigation resilient.",
                                "focus": "Sofia implementing David's Facing Emotions protocol—diagnosing emotional brittleness (suppression creating rigidity), proposing Emotion Navigation Protocol (three-step practice: Pattern Identification mapping triggers, Name-It-To-Tame-It labeling reducing intensity, Values-Aligned Action maintaining principles under stress), implementing revealing emotional intelligence advantage (fear pattern identification, reactivity reduction, psychological coherence), observing 60-day transformation (45% volatility decrease, creativity increase, resilience deepening) demonstrating agility creating adaptive strength suppression cannot.",
