 (8-month sustained pressure increasing cohesion), setbacks transformed into learning (Option B reframe), cosmic authorities' endurance expectation shattered (rebellion treating multi-year siege as strength-building opportunity not survival challenge). London Hue completing: strategic maturity fully realized recognizing ultimate resilience emerges from integrated systems—isolated strength limited, unified practices creating anti-fragile superiority authorities' fragmented approaches psychologically cannot match.",
