                                  "Facilitate a peer support session—Supportive Peer Networks (small groups providing accountability + emotional processing + perspective-sharing) prevent isolation fragility (Sandberg/Grant: community support sustaining resilience during hardship, peer accountability maintaining commitment, shared processing normalizing difficulty reducing shame)",
                                  "Journal daily gratitude during hardship—Daily Gratitude Checkpoints (maintaining appreciative orientation even during adversity) prevent bitterness demoralization (Sandberg/Grant: gratitude practice counteracting negativity bias, appreciation during difficulty building perspective, daily rhythm sustaining hope through prolonged challenges)"
