                                "focus": "Advisory council synthesizing Newport + Bagchi—proposing Comprehensive Professional Identity (unifying craftsman skills, deep work concentration, professional character), creating four pillars (Personal Code ethics, Values-Decisions framework, Mentorship culture, Standards assessment), operating synergistically as anti-fragile professionalism (complexity → Code, Values preventing shortcuts, Mentorship propagating, Standards maintaining), demonstrating 120-day superiority (cosmic respect, partnership attraction, deep satisfaction) showing integrated character + competence creating world-class professionalism technical skill cannot.",
                                "chapterSceneFocus": "Ch136S3: Completing professional mastery via identity integration—synthesis showing unified skills + concentration + character via four pillars creates world-class professionalism (cosmic respect, partnerships, satisfaction) technical competence alone cannot achieve",
