                      "major_task_group_description": "Emotional Intelligence involves understanding and managing one’s emotions while empathizing with and relating to the emotions of others. By cultivating self-awareness, self-regulation, and empathy, individuals can navigate interpersonal dynamics effectively, resolve conflicts with compassion, and foster meaningful connections. Emotional Intelligence provides the foundation for resilient teamwork, empathetic leadership, and supportive environments that bolster both personal well-being and communal harmony.",
