mapping exposing 12 unexploited synergies (rebellion's temporal mechanics + neutral faction's diplomatic networks + reformed entities' reality manipulation = unprecedented capabilities), joint forums producing innovations no single faction could generate, rotating liaisons breaking silos creating coalition-wide perspective. Vivid Violet deepening: collaborative sophistication recognizing influence requiring not just trust but systematic integration—parallel work limited, cross-functional synergy transformative.",
