                              "saveTheCatBeat": "Approach to Innermost Cave - completing equitable partnership via comprehensive cultural integration",
                              "narrativeFunction": "Completes Approach to Innermost Cave collaboration phase (achieving cultural partnership) by demonstrating belonging integration—assessing transformation (Scene 1 trust safety, Scene 2 integration productivity) recognizing cultural gap (mechanical not organic). Shows Lencioni + Hansen + Coyle synthesis: advisory council proposing Comprehensive Partnership Culture (unifying trust/integration/belonging), creating three practices (Body Language inclusion, Voice Invitations participation, Joint Celebrations identity), operating synergistically as anti-fragile partnership (self-sustaining culture), demonstrating 90-day superiority (73% belonging, innovation acceleration, alliance attraction). Demonstrates that integrated culture creates self-sustaining partnership—organic collaboration outperforming mechanical structures. Completes Two of Wands: cultural partnership perfection. Completes Vivid Violet: integrated cultural influence. Ends partnership Approach: equitable collaboration achieved. Ends chapter ready Books 5-9 self-sustaining cultural coalition dominance.",
