                                "Reflect others' emotions verbally—Emotion Reflection Protocol (explicitly naming observed feelings: frustration/anxiety/excitement) validates emotional experience (Goleman: emotion naming making invisible visible, verbal reflection demonstrating attunement, validation permission creating engagement emotional dismissal destroys)",
