                              "focus": "Advisory council synthesizing Goleman + Rosenberg + Ross—proposing Strategic Empathy Integration (unifying attunement, dialogue, strategic infrastructure), creating three systems (Empathy Journey Mapping organizational awareness, Workflow Checkpoints process-embedded compassion, Team Training skill propagation), operating synergistically as anti-fragile empathic culture (systemic understanding, sustained compassion, competence spreading), demonstrating 60-day superiority (82% deeply understood, innovation acceleration) showing integrated organizational empathy creating self-sustaining culture individual practices cannot.",
