                              "scene_number": 2,
                              "title": "Power Posing Embodied Confidence",
                              "setup": "Four weeks after Introvert Leadership (05/17/1323), rebellion experiencing unexpected confidence paradox: while Francisco's quiet strength validated (assemblies responding positively, coalition valuing depth), physical anxiety persisting—body language betraying internal confidence (hunched posture, minimal eye contact, closed gestures) signaling uncertainty exactly when cosmic leadership requiring presence, cognitive confidence insufficient without embodied assurance undermining influence. Drawing from Cuddy's Presence Power Posing framework, Marcus recognizes mind-body disconnect: mental confidence (Francisco accepting introvert validity) not translating to physical confidence—body stuck in anxiety patterns (defensive postures manifesting self-protection) preventing full leadership emergence. The Eight of Swords revealing embodiment truth: anxiety not just mental (thoughts patterns) but physical (body memory)—cognitive work addressing mind incomplete without somatic intervention addressing body. Marcus proposes 'Embodied Confidence Architecture': systematic physicality via three practices: (1) Daily Power Poses (Francisco adopting expansive postures: wide stance, open chest, raised arms two minutes before critical moments elevating confidence hormones), (2) Pre-Post Confidence Tracking (recording self-assessed confidence levels before/after power poses measuring embodied intervention impact), (3) Peer Coaching Sessions (Francisco teaching coalition members posture techniques: reinforcing learning through instruction, normalizing body-based confidence work). Implementation reveals embodiment advantage: power posing increasing self-assessed confidence 37% pre-post measurements, confidence gains persisting beyond immediate pose moments, peer coaching deepening Francisco's own embodiment (teaching consolidating understanding). Tyrian Purple deepening: confidence requiring not just mental validation but physical embodiment—mind-only partial, body-mind integration complete leadership presence authorities' disembodied cognitive approaches somatically cannot achieve.",
                              "symbolism": "Eight of Swords deepening—embodied anxiety releasing, physical patterns transforming. Tyrian Purple deepening—confidence via body-mind integration. Cuddy's Power Posing: body language shaping internal confidence.",
                              "beat_goal": "Deepen Approach to Innermost Cave confidence (refining embodiment) by demonstrating power posing—showing Cuddy's Presence Power Posing principle that embodied practices (Daily Poses elevating hormones, Confidence Tracking measuring impact, Peer Coaching reinforcing learning) create physical confidence (37% increase, persistence, consolidation) cognitive validation alone cannot achieve.",
