                              "setup": "Eight weeks after Embodied Confidence (07/12/1323), rebellion assessing comprehensive confidence transformation: Scene 1 introvert strength creating quiet leadership advantage (45% strategic decisions, 43% confidence increase), Scene 2 embodied practices enabling physical assurance (37% power pose confidence, body-mind integration). But Francisco recognizes authenticity challenge: confidence functioning technically—quiet strength validated, body-language transformed, yet lacking authentic vulnerable presence where leadership felt genuinely human not just competent, cosmic coalition experiencing Francisco as capable but distant. Drawing synthesis from Cain + Cuddy + Brown's Daring Greatly Power of Vulnerability framework, advisory council proposes 'Comprehensive Authentic Leadership': unified approach combining introvert strengths (quiet depth), embodied confidence (physical assurance), vulnerability courage (authentic connection) into holistic leadership presence. The Eight of Swords completing: anxiety fully released—self-imposed restraints (performance expectations, embodied tension, vulnerability avoidance) dissolving via integrated practices. Tyrian Purple completing: powerful confidence fully realized—technical competence impressive, authentic vulnerable presence transformative creating genuine cosmic influence authorities' polished invulnerable approaches emotionally cannot replicate. Integration creates three synchronized practices: (1) Personal Story Sharing (Francisco sharing authentic struggles: rebellion journey challenges/doubts/fears humanizing cosmic leadership), (2) Team Vulnerability Exercises (coalition practicing emotional risk-taking: safe forums discussing uncertainties/mistakes creating collective authenticity), (3) Emotional Risk Documentation (members reflecting on vulnerability moments: journaling lessons learned building courage repertoire). Three practices operating synergistically creating anti-fragi