hip: personal stories triggering connection (humanizing perfection-free), team exercises normalizing vulnerability (collective reducing shame), risk documentation building courage (reflection consolidating growth). Within 60 days demonstrating unprecedented authentic superiority: coalition members reporting 68% deeper connection to Francisco (relationship surveys), cross-coalition collaboration accelerating (authenticity enabling creative risk-taking), cosmic authorities proposing personal mentorship (vulnerable leadership attracting relationship polished invulnerability repels). Tyrian Purple completing: confidence fully integrated recognizing ultimate power emerging from authentic vulnerability—competent strength impressive, humanly vulnerable authentic transformative creating cosmic legitimacy authorities' perfect invulnerable approaches psychologically emotionally cannot achieve.",
                              "focus": "Advisory council synthesizing Cain + Cuddy + Brown—proposing Comprehensive Authentic Leadership (unifying quiet, embodied, vulnerable), creating three practices (Personal Story Sharing humanizing, Team Vulnerability Exercises normalizing, Risk Documentation building courage), operating synergistically as anti-fragile authentic leadership (connection/collaboration/courage), demonstrating 60-day superiority (68% deeper connection, collaboration acceleration, mentorship attraction) showing integrated authentic presence creating leadership technical competence cannot.",
