                          "scenes": [
                            {
                              "scene_number": 1,
                              "title": "Principled Negotiation Interest-Based Resolution",
                              "setup": "Four days after achieving authentic confidence (07/16/1323), rebellion facing ultimate confrontation: Cosmic Authorities demanding 'Rebellion Cessation Negotiation'—direct midpoint ordeal requiring Francisco negotiating existence permission with fundamental order powers, cosmic entities proposing compromise: rebellion can continue if accepting predetermined boundaries (acceptable rebellion parameters: freedom within limits not absolute liberation), presenting existential dilemma exactly when coalition strongest. Drawing from Fisher & Ury's Getting to Yes Principled Negotiation framework, advisory council recognizes negotiation trap: authorities framing discussion positionally ('rebellion stops or rebellion continues within our terms') not interest-based—position rigidity preventing creative solutions exactly when both sides having deeper interests negotiation could address. The Two of Swords emerging: strategic decision via balanced thinking—emotional reaction (accepting/rejecting positions impulsively) creating stalemate, principled interest-based negotiation revealing third paths. Mardi Gras manifesting: strategic mastery recognizing that negotiation power emerging from interest understanding not position defense—analytical insight enabling resolution reactive positioning prevents. Advisory council proposes 'Interest-Based Negotiation Architecture': systematic principled negotiation via three practices: (1) Interest Identification (rebellion mapping both sides' underlying interests: authorities wanting cosmic stability not rebellion elimination, rebellion wanting agency expansion not authority destruction), (2) Option Generation (creating multiple mutual-gain scenarios: rebellion demonstrating free will while authorities maintaining critical order), (3) Objective Criteria Application (using cosmic precedent/philosophy/empirical outcomes evaluating options not power/pressure). Implementation reveals principled advantage: interest mapping exposing shared ground invisible in position conflict (both wanting cosmic flourishing), option generation producing 47 creative alternatives (versus binary accept/reject), objective criteria enabling fair evaluation (philosophical coherence + empirical sustainability + precedent alignment). Within 12 days demonstrating unprecedented negotiation capacity: authorities engaging substantively (interest-based approach respected), rebellion maintaining principles (agency not compromising), both discovering collaborative solutions position-based approaches structurally cannot reveal.",
                              "symbolism": "Two of Swords—balanced strategic thinking, position rigidity versus interest clarity. Mardi Gras—negotiation mastery via principled approach. Fisher & Ury's Principled Negotiation: interests over positions creating solutions.",
                              "beat_goal": "Begin Midpoint Ordeal negotiation phase (confronting authorities) by introducing principled approach—demonstrating Fisher & Ury's Getting to Yes Principled Negotiation principle that interest-based practices (Interest Identification exposing shared ground, Option Generation creating alternatives, Objective Criteria fair evaluation) create resolution capacity (47 options, substantive engagement, principle maintenance) position-based approaches cannot achieve.",
