                              "saveTheCatBeat": "Midpoint - beginning ordeal negotiation via principled interest-based approach",
                              "narrativeFunction": "Begins Midpoint Ordeal negotiation phase (confronting authorities) by introducing Rebellion Cessation challenge—cosmic authorities demanding compromise (freedom within predetermined boundaries) presenting existential dilemma. Demonstrates Fisher & Ury's Getting to Yes: advisory council recognizing negotiation trap (positional framing preventing creativity), proposing Interest-Based Negotiation Architecture (Interest Identification exposing shared ground, Option Generation creating 47 alternatives, Objective Criteria fair evaluation), implementing revealing principled advantage (both wanting cosmic flourishing, mutual-gain scenarios, legitimate standards). Shows that interest-based approach creates resolution—principled negotiation outperforming positional conflict. Introduces Two of Swords: strategic balanced thinking. Manifests Mardi Gras: principled negotiation mastery. Begins ordeal negotiation. Sets up Scene 2 exploring emotional management and Scene 3 building crucial dialogue. Plants foundation for Books 4-9 principled cosmic negotiation.",
