                              "setup": "Six weeks after Emotional Disentanglement (09/17/1323), rebellion assessing comprehensive negotiation transformation: Scene 1 interest-based approach creating substantive options (47 alternatives, shared ground), Scene 2 emotional management enabling productive dialogue (53% heated reduction, empathy emerging). But Francisco recognizes conversational challenge: negotiation having tools (principled interests, emotion management) yet lacking crucial dialogue mastery—high-stakes conversations (final authority decision-making moments) devolving into silence or violence (withholding truth or aggressive assertion) exactly when collaborative decision requiring all voices engaged safely. Drawing synthesis from Fisher/Ury + Stone/Patton/Heen + Patterson's Crucial Conversations STATE/Mutual Purpose framework, advisory council proposes 'Comprehensive Dialogue Mastery': unified approach combining principled negotiation (interest-based solutions), emotional management (feelings disentangled), crucial dialogue (safe truth-telling) into complete resolution capacity. The Two of Swords completing: strategic decision mastery achieved—positional rigidity (transcended via interests), emotional reactivity (managed via disentanglement), conversational breakdown (solved via dialogue skills) all addressed creating analytical clarity enabling optimal collaborative choices cosmic authorities' incomplete approaches cannot achieve. Integration creates three synchronized practices: (1) Mutual Purpose Establishment (rebellion/authorities explicitly articulating shared purpose before crucial conversations: cosmic flourishing mutual commitment, safety foundation), (2) STATE Skills Application (rebellion using Share facts/Tell story/Ask for others' views/Talk tentatively/Encourage testing when sharing tough messages: vulnerable yet clear communication), (3) Active Listening Mirroring (both sides practicing repeating back what heard: demonstrating understanding before responding, psychological safety multiplying). Three practices operating synergistically creating anti-fragile dialogue: mutual purpose creating foundation (shared commitment enabling disagreement), STATE skills enabling truth-telling (vulnerable communication preventing silence/violence), active listening preventing misunderstanding (demonstrated understanding enabling trust unidirectional assertion cannot build). Within 10 days demonstrating unprecedented resolution: final agreement reached preserving rebellion agency while addressing authorities' stability concerns, 89% both sides satisfaction (measured via post-negotiation surveys), cosmic precedent established (principled collaborative negotiation becoming model). Mardi Gras completing: strategic mastery fully realized recognizing ultimate negotiation power emerging from integrated approach—principled interests providing direction, emotional management enabling engagement, crucial dialogue actualizing resolution creating cosmic legitimacy authorities' fragmented partial approaches holistically cannot achieve.",
                              "symbolism": "Two of Swords completing—strategic dialogue mastery, complete integration enabling optimal decisions. Mardi Gras completing—ultimate negotiation mastery via synthesis. Fisher/Ury + Stone/Patton/Heen + Patterson: complete resolution architecture.",
                              "beat_goal": "Complete Midpoint Ordeal negotiation phase (achieving resolution mastery) by demonstrating dialogue integration—showing that unifying principled negotiation (interests + options + criteria) + emotional management (disentanglement) + crucial dialogue (STATE/Mutual Purpose/Mirroring) via three practices creates resolution (final agreement, 89% satisfaction, cosmic precedent) fragmented approaches cannot achieve.",
                              "pov": "3rd Person Limited (Francisco)",
