fore responding, psychological safety multiplying). Three practices operating synergistically creating anti-fragile dialogue: mutual purpose creating foundation (shared commitment enabling disagreement), STATE skills enabling truth-telling (vulnerable communication preventing silence/violence), active listening preventing misunderstanding (demonstrated understanding enabling trust unidirectional assertion cannot build). Within 10 days demonstrating unprecedented resolution: final agreement reached preserving rebellion agency while addressing authorities' stability concerns, 89% both sides satisfaction (post-negotiation surveys), cosmic precedent established (principled collaborative negotiation becoming model). Mardi Gras completing: strategic mastery fully realized recognizing ultimate negotiation power emerging from integrated approach—principled interests providing direction, emotional management enabling engagement, crucial dialogue actualizing resolution creating cosmic legitimacy authorities' fragmented partial approaches holistically cannot achieve.",
                              "focus": "Advisory council synthesizing Fisher/Ury + Stone/Patton/Heen + Patterson—proposing Comprehensive Dialogue Mastery (unifying principled/emotional/conversational), creating three practices (Mutual Purpose Establishment, STATE Skills Application, Active Listening Mirroring), operating synergistically as anti-fragile dialogue (foundation/truth-telling/understanding), demonstrating 10-day resolution (final agreement, 89% satisfaction, cosmic precedent) showing integrated dialogue creating capacity fragmented cannot.",
                              "chapterSceneFocus": "Ch140S3: Completing negotiation via dialogue integration—synthesis showing unified principled+emotional+conversational via practices creates resolution (agreement, 89% satisfaction, precedent) fragmented approaches cannot achieve",
