                              "saveTheCatBeat": "Midpoint - completing ordeal negotiation via integrated dialogue mastery synthesis",
                              "narrativeFunction": "Completes Midpoint Ordeal negotiation phase (achieving resolution mastery) by demonstrating dialogue integration—assessing transformation (Scene 1 principled tools, Scene 2 emotional tools) recognizing conversational gap (silence/violence patterns). Shows Fisher/Ury + Stone/Patton/Heen + Patterson synthesis: advisory council proposing Comprehensive Dialogue Mastery (unifying principled/emotional/conversational), creating three practices (Mutual Purpose foundation, STATE Skills truth-telling, Active Listening understanding), operating synergistically as anti-fragile dialogue (safety/communication/trust), demonstrating 10-day resolution (final agreement, 89% satisfaction, cosmic precedent). Demonstrates that integrated dialogue creates mastery—holistic approach outperforming fragmented tools. Completes Two of Swords: strategic decision integration. Completes Mardi Gras: ultimate negotiation mastery. Ends ordeal negotiation: collaborative resolution achieved. Ends chapter ready Books 5-9 integrated negotiation cosmic model dominance establishing precedent.",
