                      "major_task_group_description": "Controlled Power focuses on unleashing one’s innate strengths, capabilities, and competitive edge while maintaining discipline and responsibility. By developing a solid moral foundation and strategic mindset, individuals learn to channel their energy toward constructive outcomes. Harnessing power effectively requires emotional regulation, thoughtful decision-making, and consistent self-improvement, ensuring that ambition and influence are grounded in respect and ethical considerations.",
