                              "scene_number": 1,
                              "title": "Emotional Self-Regulation Controlled Power",
                              "setup": "Fifteen days after intrinsic performance (03/31/1324). Performance systems optimized but emotional volatility undermining—cosmic crisis triggering reactive leadership threatening stability. Drawing from Goleman's Emotional Intelligence Self-Regulation, advisory council proposes Controlled Power Framework: Mindfulness Trigger Recognition identifying emotional cues, Pause-Plan Protocol creating space before reactions, Emotion-Regulation Routines building self-mastery practices. Implementation creates 77% emotional stability, controlled leadership, and compassionate power within 19 days.",
