                              "focus": "Council implementing Goleman framework—proposing Self-Regulation Framework, observing stability demonstrating emotion management creating controlled power.",
                              "chapterSceneFocus": "Ch143S1: Beginning controlled power via self-regulation—Goleman showing emotion management creates compassionate leadership",
