                      "major_task_group_title": "Progressive Humanism",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Progressive Humanism emphasizes the continuous advancement of human welfare, dignity, and collective flourishing through reason, ethics, and compassionate action. By championing open dialogue, critical thinking, and egalitarian values, it aims to uplift individuals and societies, fostering a future driven by empathy and an unwavering commitment to the common good. Recognizing both the power of innovation and the importance of shared humanity, Progressive Humanism lays a moral and intellectual framework for confronting pressing challenges and imagining ethical pathways forward.",
