                      "major_task_group_title": "Interpersonal Dynamics",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Interpersonal Dynamics delves into the subtle exchanges and underlying motivations that shape human interactions—be it within friendships, families, or professional teams. By recognizing emotional cues, communication patterns, and social contexts, individuals can develop deeper empathy, effectively manage conflict, and foster authentic relationships. Emphasizing active listening, open-mindedness, and continuous reflection, Interpersonal Dynamics equips people to adapt, collaborate, and thrive in an increasingly interconnected world.",
