                          },
                          "summary": "Francisco experiences the pivotal moment when his journey shifts direction under the influence of cosmic fate. He learns to recognize and harness karma - the universal law that every action carries consequences across timelines. This understanding transforms him from a student of cosmic forces into an active participant in the cosmic web of cause and effect, marking his true crossing into the realm of cosmic guardianship.",
