                          "summary": "When confronted by cosmic gatekeepers who seek to limit his access to certain realms, Francisco develops tactics to stay unpredictable and maintain the initiative. He learns that elusive intent - the ability to keep his true purposes hidden while working toward cosmic balance - is sometimes necessary for overcoming resistance to positive change. This strategic approach becomes essential for navigating cosmic politics.",
