                      "major_task_group_title": "Organizational Synergy",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Organizational Synergy focuses on bringing together diverse talents, resources, and perspectives within a group to create outcomes greater than the sum of individual contributions. By prioritizing open communication, shared objectives, and mutual trust, teams can break down silos, spark creativity, and solve problems collaboratively. Through a structured blend of leadership, culture-building, and continuous feedback loops, organizational synergy facilitates an environment where each member thrives and collectively propels the entire organization toward sustained success.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Harnessing collective strength to amplify innovation, productivity, and unified progress.",
