                            "Resilience_Development": "Francisco's growing ability to bounce back from failure and extract value from difficult experiences."
                          },
                          "story_gaps_addressed": {
                            "failure_mastery": "Francisco learns that cosmic guardianship requires the ability to fail forward and extract learning from setbacks.",
