                      "major_task_group_title": "Enlightened Perseverance",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Enlightened Perseverance combines unwavering resolve with introspection, helping individuals maintain focus on their goals despite setbacks or evolving circumstances. By pairing diligence and determination with reflective practice, we learn from each challenge, honing our strategies and deepening our understanding of ourselves. In doing so, Enlightened Perseverance fosters a mindset where persistence is guided by wisdom, empathy, and a clear sense of purpose—ensuring that personal advancement and ethical responsibility evolve in tandem.",
