                      "major_task_group_title": "Economic Foresight",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Economic Foresight involves proactively analyzing market trends, technological shifts, and broader societal developments to make informed predictions about future opportunities and risks. By blending data-driven research with strategic thinking, individuals, organizations, and communities can adapt resource allocation, plan long-term initiatives, and cultivate resilience. In this way, Economic Foresight fosters sustainable growth and helps decision-makers anticipate challenges, charting a stable course in an ever-evolving economic landscape.",
