                        "book4": "Technological Revolutions and Financial Capital by Carlota Perez",
                        "book5": "Principles by Ray Dalio",
                        "book6": "Future Shock by Alvin Toffler",
                        "book7": "The Fourth Industrial Revolution by Klaus Schwab"
