              "sin": "Fear",
              "ennegram_name": "THE LOYALIST",
              "ennegram_description": "The Committed, Security-Oriented Type: Engaging, Responsible, Anxious, and Suspicious.",
              "business_model_you": "Who am I",
              "tagline": "Design your future by aligning intentions with bold strategies and purposeful resource management.",
              "logline": "Align your intentions with bold, resourceful strategies to drive meaningful success and unlock new opportunities for growth.",
              "description": "In 'Intentional Strategy,' you’ll discover the art of aligning purposeful intention with strategic action to unlock the full potential of your resources. This book explores how to design and implement strategies that not only meet goals but also reflect your deeper values and passions. Through a combination of proactive planning, resource management, and decisive execution, you'll learn how to turn vision into reality while staying true to your core purpose. Whether you're leading a team, managing projects, or navigating personal growth, 'Intentional Strategy' provides the tools to help you channel your energy into focused, purposeful success. Empower yourself to strategically plan, adapt, and thrive in any environment.",
              "themes": [
                "Intention",
                "Strategy",
                "Resources",
                "Passionate Purpose",
                "Strategic Action",
                "Proactive Planning",
                "Resource Management",
                "Purposeful Growth",
