                      "major_task_group_title": "Empowered Initiatives",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Empowered Initiatives inspire people to champion new projects and solutions that address shared goals with creativity, collaboration, and a sense of ownership. By providing the necessary resources, mentorship, and freedom to innovate, these initiatives can spark transformative progress on both individual and communal levels. Emphasizing trust, open dialogue, and relentless iteration, Empowered Initiatives encourage participants to evolve from passive stakeholders into active co-creators of meaningful change.",
