                      "major_task_group_title": "Proactive Leadership",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Proactive Leadership emphasizes anticipating challenges, initiating forward-thinking solutions, and leading by example. Rather than waiting for problems to arise, proactive leaders maintain a strategic mindset, empower team members through clarity and encouragement, and chart a course for sustainable success. This approach balances visionary ideas with grounded execution, inspiring confidence and collective momentum even under rapidly changing conditions.",
