                      "major_task_group_title": "Emotional Intelligence",
                      "major_task_group_description": "Emotional Intelligence underscores the ability to recognize, understand, and effectively manage our own emotions while empathizing with and relating to the emotions of others. By fostering emotional awareness, self-regulation, and empathy, individuals can communicate authentically, build stronger relationships, and navigate conflict with greater insight. The development of Emotional Intelligence stands as a cornerstone for healthy collaboration, resilience, and meaningful interpersonal connections, whether in personal or professional spheres.",
                      "major_task_group_tagline": "Elevating self-awareness and empathy to forge deeper understanding and authentic connections.",
                      "major_task_group_books_influenced_by": {
                        "book1": "Emotional Intelligence by Daniel Goleman",
