                          "summary": "Overwhelmed by the scope of cosmic reconciliation needed, Francisco initially refuses the call by focusing on diligent but limited efforts that avoid the larger challenge. He becomes methodical about smaller reconciliation tasks while avoiding the major cosmic conflicts that truly need resolution. This diligence becomes a form of avoidance that he must overcome.",
