                    "major_task_group_title": "(Budget) Temperance",
                    "major_task_group_description": "Temperance involves practicing moderation, balance, and measured control over one’s habits, resources, and decisions. By adopting a mindset of thoughtful restraint, individuals can maintain financial stability, conserve energy, and foster healthier relationships in both personal and professional settings. Temperance empowers people to align their actions with long-term goals, avoiding impulsive or excessive behaviors that can derail progress.",
                    "major_task_group_tagline": "Temperance is the art of balanced living through mindful restraint and thoughtful moderation.",
                    "major_task_group_books_influenced_by": {
                      "book1": "Your Money or Your Life by Vicki Robin and Joe Dominguez",
                      "book2": "The Total Money Makeover by Dave Ramsey",
                      "book3": "I Will Teach You to Be Rich by Ramit Sethi",
