                          },
                          "summary": "Now functioning as the Daughter of the Flaming Sword, Francisco faces cosmic gatekeepers who test his commitment to material cosmic transformation. He must demonstrate and secure tangible results from his reconciliation work - showing that cosmic healing creates real, measurable improvements in cosmic conditions rather than just temporary diplomatic agreements.",
